# Juspeace FE (`juspeace-fe`)

## Before Next.js APIs

Read version-matched docs under `juspeace-fe/node_modules/next/dist/docs/` (prefer retrieval over training data). Preserve the managed block in `juspeace-fe/AGENTS.md`.

## Stack

- App Router, TypeScript, `output: 'standalone'`
- Tailwind v4 + shadcn/ui
- TanStack Query + Form (+ Table when needed); Zustand for **cart only**
- API via `src/lib/api/*` — never hardcode base URLs in components

## Do

- Fetch catalog in Server Components
- TanStack Form + Zod for forms; TanStack Query for client server-state / mutations
- `'use client'` only for cart / forms / local UI state
- All UI strings via `t()` and `src/messages/en.json`

## Don't

- Hardcode UI copy in JSX
- Store secrets/JWTs in Zustand or localStorage
- Initialize git in this package

## Skills to apply

- `juspeace-frontend` (primary)
- `next-best-practices`, `vercel-react-best-practices` when relevant
- `juspeace-integration` when changing API contracts

## Verify

```bash
cd juspeace-fe && pnpm run build && pnpm run lint
```

